OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy in the morning with rain
OL,6,Fspreading to Argyll, mainly dry
OL,7,Felsewhere. Brighter spells possible
OL,8,Ffor a time around midday before
OL,9,Fpersistent rain, occasionally heavy,
OL,10,Fwill extend east through the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Fheavy rain spreading east through the
OL,14,Fevening. Further outbreaks of heavy
OL,15,Frain overnight, perhaps thundery for a
OL,16,Ftime, turning more showery towards
OL,17,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
