OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FBright spells and scattered
OL,6,Fshowers from the northwest through the
OL,7,Fday, occasionally heavy and thundery
OL,8,Fat first, lighter and more isolated
OL,9,Flater in the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FShowers Wednesday morning, becoming
OL,13,Fmostly dry and bright by midday. A
OL,14,Fband of heavy rain pushes east
OL,15,FWednesday evening. Frequent heavy
OL,16,Fshowers Thursday, easing Friday
OL,17,Fmorning, then further rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
